      "block_type": "plain_explanation",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "The plan's key can identify a road between A and B, a school at D and a clinic at C, with separate cultivation and river symbols. A building and its service are related but not identical answers: a clinic is the facility, healthcare the service. Read the requested field and the map evidence so a paired response does not simply repeat a building name in both spaces.",
