      "repair_note": "Visual authoring: VIS-6137-4.2-01 to -04 (generated maps) and -05 to -10 (licensed photographs, answers reconciled to the actual images) linked (Claude, self-reviewed; awaiting Codex visual review)"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "BL-6137-4.2.01-14",
      "block_type": "worked_application",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "A title can distinguish an actual place from a schematic exercise. The training geometry here is designed for consistent practice and does not supply local knowledge about an unprovided real town. Its labels identify the features used in the questions. A real-place name should be used only where the underlying resource and source actually support it. This prevents a learner applying a memorised town fact to a different map.",
      "claim_ids": [
