    {
      "block_id": "BL-6137-4.2.01-15",
      "block_type": "plain_explanation",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "The key can also identify absence of information. If cultivation is shown but crop type is not, describe cultivation rather than name a crop. If a building symbol has no function label, its shape alone may not establish a clinic or school. A blank area may be an unmapped category rather than proven bare ground. Read what the map selects and what it leaves unspecified.",
