    {
      "block_id": "BL-6137-4.2.01-19",
      "block_type": "plain_explanation",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "A well-supported interpretation can then combine elements without confusing them. The title identifies extent, the key identifies a road, the scale supplies distance and the north arrow supplies direction. None alone supplies a travel time or service frequency. The answer should state the relationship the map actually establishes and reserve wider claims for additional evidence.",
